  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/104/4d22452b7b9dce57a85e145af5bf752f..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今日は渋谷にいったよ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/104/d303ca771582d506df0700e4d83448b3..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/104/510d7eaf35bbaa4078fb426a06aa2c44..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">萌えの致死量だ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/104/5b8706bd19b859cad1b89d3830d792c9..jpg\"></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">パンケーキ食べたんだけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">このお店、お客さん入ってきたら</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">掛け声みたいのしてて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">「お帰りなさいませ！」</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">って何回か言いそうになった</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">最後可愛いお姉さんがずっと手振って</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">お見送りしてくれてて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">え、私の事好きなのかなあ</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">って思いました</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">以上です</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
